    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtopia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an unfamiliar city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There doesn't seem to be anyone around for miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did You get here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where is Everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ALL of the Clues to solve the Mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and challenging mystery simulator game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper photorealistic city to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterior and Interior areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for clues scattered all over the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You really alone here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also try the Following Challenges . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Easter Egg&quot; Challenge - How many other Archor Games Logos Appear in the Game ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Speed Run&quot; Challenge - What is the Fastest Time You can complete the game ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Scenic&quot; Pictures Challenge - Take Screenshots of the Beautiful City and share them on Social Media with Your Friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Walkthrough&quot; Challenge - Post a video of a Complete 'Walkthrough' of the entire Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Steamy Streamer&quot; Challenge - Get ALL of the Archor Games products available on Steam and Stream ALL of them Beginning to End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Youtopia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in an unfamiliar city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There doesn't seem to be anyone around for miles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did You get here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where is Everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ALL of the Clues to solve the Mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and challenging mystery simulator game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyper photorealistic city to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterior and Interior areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for clues scattered all over the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are You really alone here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also try the Following Challenges . . .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Easter Egg&quot; Challenge - How many other Archor Games Logos Appear in the Game ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Speed Run&quot; Challenge - What is the Fastest Time You can complete the game ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Scenic&quot; Pictures Challenge - Take Screenshots of the Beautiful City and share them on Social Media with Your Friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Walkthrough&quot; Challenge - Post a video of a Complete 'Walkthrough' of the entire Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Steamy Streamer&quot; Challenge - Get ALL of the Archor Games products available on Steam and Stream ALL of them Beginning to End.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... and more!</p>",
